# renv dependency-discovery ignores — keep renv.lock scoped to the modeling
# pipeline source (_targets.R, R/, _packages.R, setup.R, api/).
#
# Scratch / generated / data directories (not pipeline source). Scanning these
# both slows renv (1000s of files) and produces false "used" hits from one-off
# scripts (e.g. binom in a tmp/ helper):
tmp/
export/
_targets/
cache/
inst/
#
# Quarto report documents belong to Subsystem 3 (artifact reproduction —
# deferred). They pull render-only packages (magick, shiny, tigris, flextable,
# officer, ...) that are NOT part of the modeling pipeline. Re-enable the
# relevant ones and re-snapshot when Subsystem 3 is built.
*.qmd
